    <rdfs:label>Act Lifecycle: completed nullified states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the completed nullified path of the Act Lifecycle workflow, in order: completed, nullified. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The lifecycle of an act in the HL7 v3 Reference Information Model: preparatory (new, held), active, suspended, and the terminal states completed, cancelled, aborted, with nullified and obsolete outside the normal course. The generic clinical and administrative act state machine.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
