  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/mc-sdxzxke44myw361ozn1n71y3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ontology/sdc4-meta/ModelComponent"/>
    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdOrdinalType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Act Lifecycle: new held states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the new held path of the Act Lifecycle workflow, in order: new, held. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The lifecycle of an act in the HL7 v3 Reference Information Model: preparatory (new, held), active, suspended, and the terminal states completed, cancelled, aborted, with nullified and obsolete outside the normal course. The generic clinical and administrative act state machine.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
